  "title": "Asian-Inspired Chicken Lettuce Wraps",
  "description": "Ground chicken, water chestnuts, and green onions are cooked in a zesty hoisin sauce, bringing tons of Asian flavor to these easy-to-make lettuce wraps.",
  "authors": [
    "Ashley Graeff"
